# Never copy dependency trees or build output into the build context: they are
# rebuilt inside the image, and a host-built tree can carry the wrong platform's
# native binaries.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
out
**/out
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
# Grammars are copied out of node_modules inside the image, not from the host.
apps/web/grammars

# Secrets must never reach the build context, let alone a layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
*.log
.DS_Store

# Documentation and local-only material have no bearing on the image.
docs
README.md
AGENTS.md
NOTICE
LICENSE-ADDITIONAL-TERMS.md
